  "description": "One day, a cat named \"Thanks\" encounters a homeless person. \"Thanks\" naturally names the human he brought home \"Yangji\", and starts to live with her. Since he's raising a human for the first time, there are a lot of new things that Thanks has to learn.\n\nThe beautiful (!) daily life of Yangji, who's hopelessly full of energy, and Thanks, an inexperienced owner, begins!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/69429407), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/cat_butler) \n\nPromotional Twitter",
